> Potions, scrolls, candles, gems and stones (might have left some there)
> don't have enchantments and are stackable so you can have six different
> stacks:
>
> a - a scroll of identify
> b - 5 scrolls of identify
> c - a scroll of identify
> d - a blessed scroll of identify
> e - 5 uncursed scrolls of identify
> f - a cursed scroll of identify
>
> a, b and c don't stack as they have different but unknown buc-status. b
> is probably uncursed scrolls, but which of a and c is cursed and which
> is blessed is for you to find out.
>
> The stacking can be used to identify c from bu. If you find that your
> pet walks only reluctantly over a scroll of identify, you can name it as
> 'a scroll of identify named cursed'. Now when you pick up another scroll
> of identify it will merge with the named scroll if it's cursed.

